The claimant is entitled to a total compensation of `6,32,000/- together with interest at 6% p.a.,
from the date of petition till realization;
- 18 - NC: 2025:KHC:9899-DB iii. The insurer shall deposit the balance compensation, if any, within four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment.

